\p \v 10 “\w What|strong="H04100"\w* \w have you done|strong="H06213"\w*?” \w replied [the LORD]|strong="H00559"\w*. “\w The voice|strong="H06963"\w* \w of your brother’s|strong="H00251"\w* \w blood|strong="H01818"\w* \w cries out|strong="H06817"\w* \w to Me|strong="H00413"\w* \w from|strong="H04480"\w* \w the ground|strong="H00127"\w*. \v 11 \w Now|strong="H06258"\w* \w you|strong="H00859"\w* \w [are] cursed and banished|strong="H00779"\w* \w from|strong="H04480"\w* \w the ground|strong="H00127"\w*, \w which|strong="H00834"\w* \w has opened|strong="H06475"\w* \w -|strong="H00853"\w* \w its mouth|strong="H06310"\w* \w to receive|strong="H03947"\w* \w -|strong="H00853"\w* \w your brother’s|strong="H00251"\w* \w blood|strong="H01818"\w* \w from your hand|strong="H03027"\w*. \v 12 \w When|strong="H03588"\w* \w you till|strong="H05647"\w* \w -|strong="H00853"\w* \w the ground|strong="H00127"\w*, \w {it will} no|strong="H03808"\w* \w longer|strong="H03254"\w* \w yield|strong="H05414"\w* \w its produce|strong="H03581"\w* to you. \w You will be|strong="H01961"\w* \w a fugitive|strong="H05128"\w* \w and a wanderer|strong="H05110"\w* \w on the earth|strong="H00776"\w*.”
