\s1 Shem’s Blessing and Noah’s Death
\p \v 26 \w He also declared|strong="H00559"\w*:
\b 
\q1 “\w Blessed|strong="H01288"\w* \w [be] the LORD|strong="H03068"\w*, \w the God|strong="H00430"\w* \w of Shem|strong="H08035"\w*!
