\p \v 29 \w -|strong="H03426"\w* \w I have power to do|strong="H06213"\w* \w . . .|strong="H00410"\w* \w . . .|strong="H03027"\w* \w you|strong="H05973"\w* \w great harm|strong="H07451"\w*, \w but last night|strong="H00570"\w* \w the God|strong="H00430"\w* \w of your father|strong="H00001"\w* \w said|strong="H00559"\w* \w to me|strong="H00413"\w* \w . . .|strong="H00559"\w*, ‘\w Be careful|strong="H08104"\w* \w not to say|strong="H01696"\w* \w anything to|strong="H05973"\w* \w Jacob|strong="H03290"\w*, \w either good|strong="H02896"\w* \w or|strong="H05704"\w* \w bad|strong="H07451"\w*.’ \v 30 \w Now|strong="H06258"\w* \w you have gone off|strong="H01980"\w* \w . . .|strong="H01980"\w* \w because|strong="H03588"\w* \w you long|strong="H03700"\w* \w . . .|strong="H03700"\w* \w for your father’s|strong="H00001"\w* \w house|strong="H01004"\w*. \w But why|strong="H04100"\w* \w have you stolen|strong="H01589"\w* \w -|strong="H00853"\w* \w my gods|strong="H00430"\w*?”
