\p \v 17 “\w They have moved on|strong="H05265"\w* \w from here|strong="H02088"\w*,” \w . . .|strong="H03588"\w* \w the man|strong="H00376"\w* \w answered|strong="H00559"\w*. “\w I heard them|strong="H08085"\w* \w say|strong="H00559"\w*, ‘\w Let us go|strong="H01980"\w* \w to Dothan|strong="H01886"\w*.’” \w So Joseph|strong="H03130"\w* \w set out|strong="H01980"\w* \w after|strong="H00310"\w* \w his brothers|strong="H00251"\w* \w and found them|strong="H04672"\w* \w at Dothan|strong="H01886"\w*.
