\p \w But she replied|strong="H00559"\w*, “\w Only if|strong="H00518"\w* \w you leave me|strong="H05414"\w* \w something as a pledge|strong="H06162"\w* \w until|strong="H05704"\w* \w you send it|strong="H07971"\w*.”
\p \v 18 “\w What|strong="H04100"\w* \w pledge|strong="H06162"\w* \w -|strong="H00834"\w* \w should I give|strong="H05414"\w* you?” \w he asked|strong="H00559"\w*.
\p \w She answered|strong="H00559"\w*, “\w Your seal|strong="H02368"\w* \w and your cord|strong="H06616"\w*, \w and the staff|strong="H04294"\w* \w -|strong="H00834"\w* \w in your hand|strong="H03027"\w*.” \w So he gave them|strong="H05414"\w* to her \w and slept with|strong="H00935"\w* \w her|strong="H00413"\w*, \w and she became pregnant|strong="H02029"\w* by him. \v 19 \w Then Tamar got up|strong="H06965"\w* \w and departed|strong="H01980"\w*. \w And she removed|strong="H05493"\w* \w her veil|strong="H06809"\w* \w . . .|strong="H05921"\w* \w and put on her widow’s|strong="H00491"\w* \w garments|strong="H00899"\w* \w again|strong="H03847"\w*.
\p \v 20 \w Now when Judah|strong="H03063"\w* \w -|strong="H00853"\w* \w sent|strong="H07971"\w* \w his friend [Hirah]|strong="H07453"\w* \w the Adullamite|strong="H05726"\w* \w with|strong="H03027"\w* \w the young goat|strong="H01423"\w* \w . . .|strong="H05795"\w* \w to collect|strong="H03947"\w* \w the items he had left with|strong="H06162"\w* \w . . .|strong="H03027"\w* \w the woman|strong="H00802"\w*, \w he could not|strong="H03808"\w* \w find her|strong="H04672"\w*. \v 21 \w He asked|strong="H07592"\w* \w -|strong="H00853"\w*\w . . .|strong="H00559"\w* \w the men|strong="H00582"\w* \w of that place|strong="H04725"\w*, “\w Where|strong="H00346"\w* \w is the shrine prostitute|strong="H06948"\w* \w who|strong="H01931"\w* \w was beside|strong="H05921"\w* \w the road|strong="H01870"\w* \w at Enaim|strong="H05879"\w*?”
\p “\w No|strong="H03808"\w* \w shrine prostitute|strong="H06948"\w* \w has been|strong="H01961"\w* \w here|strong="H02088"\w*,” \w they answered|strong="H00559"\w*.
