\p \v 23 “Let her \w keep the items|strong="H03947"\w*,” \w Judah|strong="H03063"\w* \w replied|strong="H00559"\w*. “\w Otherwise|strong="H06435"\w* \w we will become|strong="H01961"\w* \w a laughingstock|strong="H00937"\w*.\f + \fr 38:23 \ft Or \fqa we will become despised\f* \w After all|strong="H02009"\w*, \w I did send her|strong="H07971"\w* \w this|strong="H02088"\w* \w young goat|strong="H01423"\w*, \w but you|strong="H00859"\w* \w could not|strong="H03808"\w* \w find her|strong="H04672"\w*.”
