\p \v 7 “\w Why|strong="H04100"\w* \w does my lord|strong="H00113"\w* \w say|strong="H01696"\w* \w these|strong="H00428"\w* \w things|strong="H01697"\w*?” \w they asked|strong="H00559"\w* \w . . .|strong="H00413"\w*. “\w Your servants|strong="H05650"\w* \w could not possibly|strong="H02486"\w* \w do|strong="H06213"\w* \w such|strong="H02088"\w* \w a thing|strong="H01697"\w*. \v 8 \w vvv|strong="H02005"\w* \w We even brought back|strong="H07725"\w* \w to you|strong="H00413"\w* \w from the land|strong="H00776"\w* \w of Canaan|strong="H03667"\w* \w the silver|strong="H03701"\w* \w -|strong="H00834"\w* \w we found|strong="H04672"\w* \w in the mouths|strong="H06310"\w* \w of our sacks|strong="H00572"\w*. \w Why|strong="H00349"\w* \w would we steal|strong="H01589"\w* \w silver|strong="H03701"\w* \w or|strong="H00176"\w* \w gold|strong="H02091"\w* \w from your master’s|strong="H00113"\w* \w house|strong="H01004"\w*? \v 9 \w If any|strong="H00834"\w* \w of your servants|strong="H05650"\w* \w is found|strong="H04672"\w* \w to have it|strong="H00854"\w*, \w he must die|strong="H04191"\w*, \w and the rest|strong="H00587"\w* \w . . .|strong="H01571"\w* \w will become|strong="H01961"\w* \w slaves|strong="H05650"\w* \w of my lord|strong="H00113"\w*.”
