\p \v 25 \w So [the brothers] went up|strong="H05927"\w* \w out of Egypt|strong="H04714"\w* \w and came|strong="H00935"\w* \w to|strong="H00413"\w* \w their father|strong="H00001"\w* \w Jacob|strong="H03290"\w* \w in the land|strong="H00776"\w* \w of Canaan|strong="H03667"\w*. \v 26 “\w Joseph|strong="H03130"\w* \w is still|strong="H05750"\w* \w alive|strong="H02416"\w*,” \w they said|strong="H05046"\w* \w -|strong="H00559"\w*, “\w and|strong="H03588"\w* \w he|strong="H01931"\w* \w is ruler|strong="H04910"\w* \w over all|strong="H03605"\w* \w the land|strong="H00776"\w* \w of Egypt|strong="H04714"\w*!”
