\c 46
\s1 Jacob’s Journey to Egypt
\p \v 1 \w So Israel|strong="H03478"\w* \w set out|strong="H05265"\w* \w with all|strong="H03605"\w* \w that|strong="H00834"\w* he had, \w and when he came|strong="H00935"\w* \w to|strong="H00884"\w* \w Beersheba|strong="H00884"\w*, \w he offered|strong="H02076"\w* \w sacrifices|strong="H02077"\w* \w to the God|strong="H00430"\w* \w of his father|strong="H00001"\w* \w Isaac|strong="H03327"\w*. \v 2 \w And that night|strong="H03915"\w* \w God|strong="H00430"\w* \w spoke|strong="H00559"\w* \w to Israel|strong="H03478"\w* \w in a vision|strong="H04759"\w*: “\w Jacob|strong="H03290"\w*, \w Jacob|strong="H03290"\w*!” \w He said|strong="H00559"\w*.
\p “\w Here I am|strong="H02009"\w*,” \w replied Jacob|strong="H00559"\w*.
