\p \v 30 \w Then Israel|strong="H03478"\w* \w said|strong="H00559"\w* \w to|strong="H00413"\w* \w Joseph|strong="H03130"\w*, “\w Finally I can die|strong="H04191"\w*, \w now|strong="H06471"\w* \w . . .|strong="H00310"\w* \w that I have seen|strong="H07200"\w* \w -|strong="H00853"\w* \w your face|strong="H06440"\w* \w [and know] that|strong="H03588"\w* \w you are still|strong="H05750"\w* \w alive|strong="H02416"\w*!”
