\q1 \w I will disperse them|strong="H02505"\w* \w in Jacob|strong="H03290"\w*
\q2 \w and scatter them|strong="H06327"\w* \w in Israel|strong="H03478"\w*.
\b 
\q1 \v 8 \w Judah|strong="H03063"\w*,\f + \fr 49:8 \fqa Judah \ft sounds like the Hebrew for \fqa praise\ft .\f* \w . . .|strong="H00859"\w* \w your brothers|strong="H00251"\w* \w shall praise you|strong="H03034"\w*.
