\q2 \w whose branches|strong="H01323"\w* \w scale|strong="H06805"\w* \w . . .|strong="H05921"\w* \w the wall|strong="H07791"\w*.\f + \fr 49:22 \ft Or \fqa Joseph is a wild donkey, a wild donkey by a spring, with his wild colts beside the wall\f*
